Add a no-op sbrk() for Cosmopolitan.

cosmocc has none, and only the optional "memory used" diagnostic calls
sbrk(0). The header is force-included by the cosmo build.

--- a/cosmo-compat.h
+++ b/cosmo-compat.h
@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+#ifndef E2FS_COSMO_COMPAT_H
+#define E2FS_COSMO_COMPAT_H
+#include <stdint.h>
+static inline void *sbrk(intptr_t n){ (void)n; return (void*)0; }
+#endif
